      "html": "<div id=\"step-q350842\" class=\"step questionWidget\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 2</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\">Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.<div class=\"freeResponseLine\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"13\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-msubsup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c222B TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.896em; margin-left: -0.388em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\" style=\"margin-left: 0.647em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D452 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 1.506em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup><mjx-msup space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.413em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistiv